{"4563780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Infinite Cat Theorem", "steam_appid": 4563780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A 2D Retro Puzzle Adventure: Solving the Mysteries of the Circuit World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a tiny cat cast into a dreamlike world of electric circuits. Manipulate power sources and switches to send current through wires and operate various contraptions. You must muster all your wisdom to solve the puzzles ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starlight, electricity, puzzles, bugs, monsters, and a cat. In this beautiful yet cruel world of circuits, can you rise as a hero?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Circuits and Puzzles:</strong> Connect wires with power sources and switches to operate devices and solve intricate puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat and Monsters:</strong> The denizens of the circuit world will not leave you in peace. Dodge their attacks in real-time and strike back using puzzle-based weaponry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growth and Upgrades:</strong> Enhance your abilities with resources gathered throughout your journey. They will provide the strength you need to navigate this treacherous adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Companions and Bonds:</strong> Meet and build bonds with the unique characters within the circuit world. Will you be the hero they need?</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A 2D Retro Puzzle Adventure: Solving the Mysteries of the Circuit World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a tiny cat cast into a dreamlike world of electric circuits. Manipulate power sources and switches to send current through wires and operate various contraptions. You must muster all your wisdom to solve the puzzles ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starlight, e